      "writtenOn": "2022-12-07T18:15:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "all dawn objects (`wgpu::`) are reference counted internally, so they are kind of \"smart pointers\" on their own. So when we copy the queue object, it actually increases the ref count of the queue object by one. It\u0027s similar to what we do for metal backend, passing a copy of smart pointer `sk_cfp\u003cMTLCommandQueue\u003e` around.",
      "parentUuid": "f03f856f_57f74907",
